# TypeScript Type Definitions

## Core Types
All type definitions are located in [types/index.ts](mdc:types/index.ts).

## Database Models

### Layout
```typescript
interface Layout {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  layout_image: string;
  is_active: boolean;
  created_at: string;
  updated_at: string;
}
```

